    "name": "Slime Climb Scrum",
    "steam_appid": 2505470,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/a012fbbfca9260584ddd0fe946fbb736.poster.avif?t=1728015586\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/a012fbbfca9260584ddd0fe946fbb736.webm?t=1728015586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2015\u2015\u2015GOD SAID</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<i><strong>\u300cYOU CAN BECOME A GOD\u300d</strong></i>\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2015\u2015\u2015GOD SAID</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<i><strong>\u300cRISE TO THE TOP AND BECOME A GOD\u300d</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2015\u2015\u2015GOD SAID</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<i><strong>\u300cEVEN SLIME IS OKAY, I GUESS\u300d</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 About the Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a vertical-scrolling action game where players can harm each other. Embark on this challenging journey with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbOver 10 hours of torturous gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible appearance elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship (Destruction) mode, where players can harm each other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time saving mechanism in career mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racing leaderboards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbSlime Career</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a lonely journey alone and experience various emotions such as helplessness, impatience, and anger during the grueling climb that spans over 10 hours or more. Each jump brings you closer to the &quot;truth&quot; at the mountain's summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/0d1c857dfde35e5a00b9ac4f6ed8d754.poster.avif?t=1728015586\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/0d1c857dfde35e5a00b9ac4f6ed8d754.webm?t=1728015586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/0d1c857dfde35e5a00b9ac4f6ed8d754.mp4?t=1728015586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbMultiplayer Cooperation &amp; Multiplayer Race</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes multiplayer cooperation ascent and multiplayer race modes. Play cooperatively with your friends or push them back to the starting point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/b33c9eba1fdf3413147aa5b98178372e.poster.avif?t=1728015586\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/b33c9eba1fdf3413147aa5b98178372e.webm?t=1728015586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/b33c9eba1fdf3413147aa5b98178372e.mp4?t=1728015586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have prepared two &quot;unique&quot; control methods for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbFull Action Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: Arrow keys (left and right)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump: Spacebar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this control mode, movement and jumping are divided between the left and right hands, engaging both the left and right brain simultaneously for 100% focused gameplay. Your precision in controls is estimated to be 35% higher than usual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbRelaxation Leisure Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: Keyboard keys &quot;A&quot; and &quot;D&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump: Spacebar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Relaxation Leisure Mode&quot; allows for one-handed operation, freeing up your right hand to do other things like eating snacks, browsing TikTok, or playing mobile games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bESC\uff1aPAUSE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6COMMUNITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/a012fbbfca9260584ddd0fe946fbb736.poster.avif?t=1728015586\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/a012fbbfca9260584ddd0fe946fbb736.webm?t=1728015586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2015\u2015\u2015GOD SAID</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<i><strong>\u300cYOU CAN BECOME A GOD\u300d</strong></i>\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2015\u2015\u2015GOD SAID</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<i><strong>\u300cRISE TO THE TOP AND BECOME A GOD\u300d</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2015\u2015\u2015GOD SAID</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<i><strong>\u300cEVEN SLIME IS OKAY, I GUESS\u300d</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 About the Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a vertical-scrolling action game where players can harm each other. Embark on this challenging journey with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbOver 10 hours of torturous gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible appearance elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendship (Destruction) mode, where players can harm each other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time saving mechanism in career mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racing leaderboards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbSlime Career</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a lonely journey alone and experience various emotions such as helplessness, impatience, and anger during the grueling climb that spans over 10 hours or more. Each jump brings you closer to the &quot;truth&quot; at the mountain's summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/0d1c857dfde35e5a00b9ac4f6ed8d754.poster.avif?t=1728015586\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/0d1c857dfde35e5a00b9ac4f6ed8d754.webm?t=1728015586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/0d1c857dfde35e5a00b9ac4f6ed8d754.mp4?t=1728015586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbMultiplayer Cooperation &amp; Multiplayer Race</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes multiplayer cooperation ascent and multiplayer race modes. Play cooperatively with your friends or push them back to the starting point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/b33c9eba1fdf3413147aa5b98178372e.poster.avif?t=1728015586\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/b33c9eba1fdf3413147aa5b98178372e.webm?t=1728015586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505470/extras/b33c9eba1fdf3413147aa5b98178372e.mp4?t=1728015586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have prepared two &quot;unique&quot; control methods for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbFull Action Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: Arrow keys (left and right)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump: Spacebar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this control mode, movement and jumping are divided between the left and right hands, engaging both the left and right brain simultaneously for 100% focused gameplay. Your precision in controls is estimated to be 35% higher than usual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbRelaxation Leisure Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: Keyboard keys &quot;A&quot; and &quot;D&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump: Spacebar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Relaxation Leisure Mode&quot; allows for one-handed operation, freeing up your right hand to do other things like eating snacks, browsing TikTok, or playing mobile games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bESC\uff1aPAUSE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6COMMUNITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "If mutual harm is a human instinct, then we want to magnify it infinitely! Slime Climb Scrum can sprinkle a specks of darkness onto you (your) wonderful life! A 2D vertical-axis, high-difficulty jumping game that supports multiplayer cooperation and challenge modes!",
